{
  "name": "Connector: Slack (alerts)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Connector: Slack (alerts and digest)\n\nPosts move, [VERIFY] and \"call now\" alerts (with @mentions from the team directory) and the digest.\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Create a Slack incoming webhook for your alerts channel and paste it into **Config**. Optional: a second webhook for the digest.\n2. Copy this workflow's ID into the core Config (Daily Run, Digest and Call Now workflows) as `alert_connector_id`.\n\n**Actions:** alert, digest.\n\n**Publish** this workflow once it is set up (top right). n8n only lets scheduled and webhook-started runs call published workflows.\n\nContract: docs/connectors.md in the repo.",
        "height": 580,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "c7c3a12c-6d18-4692-a799-81995095b8ab",
      "name": "Note: Setup",
